---
title: 12. Multiplayer (all five steps built)
---
flowchart TB
    subgraph S1["Step 1: shared world and players (built: network.gd)"]
        direction LR
        host1["Host<br/>its saved world"] -->|"join: world settings<br/>+ edited chunks"| join1["Joining player<br/>generates the same world,<br/>applies the chunks, plays unsaved"]
        host1 <-->|"each player's position 20x a second<br/>(wrapped coordinates; the host relays)"| join1
    end

    subgraph S2["Step 2: shared sculpting (built: change tracking + network.gd)"]
        direction LR
        brush["Any tool, undo or redo<br/>applied at once locally"] -->|"every 0.1 s: the voxel values<br/>it changed (per chunk, compressed)"| owner2["Host puts batches in one order<br/>(stays with the host: every computer<br/>applies every edit anyway)"]
        owner2 -->|"ordered batch to everyone<br/>(the sender's comes back as a receipt)"| all2["Every computer applies them in order;<br/>own unconfirmed batches re-applied on top<br/>so all copies end up identical"]
    end

    subgraph S3["Step 3: shared physics (built: network.gd)"]
        direction LR
        make3["Owner: its region's owner (step 4);<br/>while someone uses it (physics gun,<br/>sculpting, object editor): them"] --> rowner["Owner simulates it<br/>(frogs: and runs their AI)"]
        rowner -->|"position, turn, velocity, spin, pose:<br/>20x/s to players within 512 voxels,<br/>1x/s to the rest; shape when sculpted"| others3["Everyone else: a frozen copy<br/>that follows (its velocity set,<br/>so their objects bounce off it)"]
        leave3["A player leaves"] -->|"host takes over<br/>their objects"| rowner
    end

    subgraph S4["Step 4: spreading the load (built: network.gd)"]
        direction LR
        reports["Each computer: benchmark score<br/>+ physics time, every 2 s"] --> dir["Host = directory<br/>256-voxel regions (32x32)"]
        dir -->|"region gets objects:<br/>nearest player owns it"| peers4["Each player's computer<br/>owns some regions"]
        dir -->|"every 2 s: load (moving objects,<br/>frogs x2) / speed; if one is 20% over<br/>another, move its region nearest<br/>the less loaded player"| peers4
        peers4 -->|"objects handed to<br/>their region's owner (every 0.5 s,<br/>unless in use)"| rowner4["Nearby objects simulated together"]
    end

    subgraph S5["Step 5: finishing (built)"]
        direction LR
        undo["Undo puts back only points<br/>still as your stroke left them:<br/>others' edits since are kept"]
        succ["Host keeps a succession list<br/>(join order, address, --backup-port)"] -->|"host leaves"| first["First in the list hosts;<br/>takes every object;<br/>saves to user://shared/world-id"]
        succ -->|"host leaves"| rest["The rest reconnect to it<br/>(next in list after 10 s),<br/>catch up as if joining,<br/>send edits made meanwhile"]
    end

    S1 --> S2 --> S3 --> S4 --> S5
